    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MPT_OBSERVER_EYE_DESCRIPTION">
      <Text>Sees the whole map through terrain and vegetation, and keeps every unit in sight. Hidden from other players; cannot found a city or be damaged.</Text>
